      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.25 (down from ₹9.88 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹7.87b (up 17% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹545.6m (down 27% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.9% (down from 11% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 14% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Machinery industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 7% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 2% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
